🏔️ BACKGROUNDS

Giant Foundling
You were raised among giants or sheltered by them and bear traces of their culture. 
- **skill proficiencies:** Intimidation, Survival
- **bonus feat:** Strike of the Giants (choose one giant strike type at character creation)

Rune Carver
You studied giant runecraft and can inscribe magical runes onto objects.
- **skill proficiencies:** History, Perception  
- **bonus feat:** Rune Shaper (learn runes that grant 1st-level spells)

---

⚔️ ORIGIN feats
note: These can be taken at any level, also note there is no great way to restrict these after taking the background.  It is generally recommended to only take the feat once.

Strike of the Giants
Channel the primeval might of giants into your weapon attacks. Choose one of six elemental strikes:| Strike | Damage Type | Effect on Failed Save |
|-------------------------|-------------|
| **cloud strike**             | Thunder      | Disadvantage on attack rolls (Wisdom)
| **fire strike**                | Fire              | Extra fire damage
| **frost strike**              | Cold            | Speed reduced to 0 (Constitution)
| **hill strike**                 | NONE          | Knocked prone (Strength)
| **stone strike**             | Force          | Pushed back 10ft (Strength)
| **storm strike**            | Lightning     | Disadvantage on attack rolls (Constitution)

Saving throws use DC 8 + your proficiency bonus + your Strength or Constitution modifier (the higher), and each strike can be used once per turn, a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus per long rest.

Each strike comes with unique VFX - ghostly spectres for Cloud, fiery infusion for Fire, icy aura for Frost, stoneskin for Stone, and lightning crackles for Storm!

Rune Shaper
Master the ancient runecraft of giants:
- Learn **comprehend languages** (free cast 1/long rest)
- Choose runes equal to half your proficiency bonus (rounded up)
- Each rune grants a 1st-level spell castable with spell slots OR free 1/long rest
- Pick Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma as your spellcasting ability**available runes:**
l Rune         | Spell 
|-----------|
| Cloud       | Fog Cloud
| Death       | Inflict Wounds 
| Dragon     | Chromatic Orb 
| Enemy      | Disguise Self 
| Fire          | Burning Hands 
| Friend      | Speak with Animals 
| Frost        | Armor of Agathys 
| Hill           | Goodberry 
| Journey   | Longstrider 
| King         | Command 
| Mountain | Entangle 
| Stone       | Sanctuary 
| Storm      | Thunderwave |

