🔥 ADVANCED GIANT FEATS
As in the book, each of these requires Level 4+ and the matching Strike of the Giants option. With Script Extender installed the level-up screen enforces it: a feat stays locked until you have its Strike.

Ember of the Fire giant
*prerequisite: Fire strike*
- **born of flame:** Resistance to fire damage
- **searing ignition:** 15ft burst dealing 1d8 + Proficiency fire damage, blinds on failed Dex save

Fury of the Frost giant
*prerequisite: Frost strike*
- **born of ice:** Resistance to cold damage
- **frigid retaliation:** Reaction when hit - 1d8 + Proficiency cold damage, freezes target on failed Con save

Guile of the Cloud giant
*prerequisite: Cloud strike*
- **cloudy escape:** Reaction when hit - become gaseous, gain resistance to ALL damage, free Misty Step

Keenness of the Stone giant
*prerequisite: Stone strike*
- **cavernous sight:** Gain or extend darkvision by 60ft
- **stone throw:** Bonus action ranged attack, 1d10 force damage, knocks prone on failed Str save

Soul of the Storm giant
*prerequisite: Storm strike*
- **maelstrom aura:** Bonus action - gain lightning/thunder resistance, disadvantage on attacks against you, enemies within 10ft have halved speed

Vigor of the Hill giant
*prerequisite: Hill strike*
- **bulwark:** Reaction to resist being pushed or knocked prone
- **iron stomach:** Extra healing during short rests equal to Con modifier + Proficiency

---

📋 INSTALLATION1. Download the mod
2. Extract to your BG3 Mods folder
3. Enable using your preferred mod manager
4. Start a new game or load a save before character creation

---

📦 REQUIREMENTS
- **BG3 Script Extender** (v22 or newer) - enforces the Giant feat prerequisites. Without it everything else works, but those feats stay open to everyone.
- **DnD 5.5e All-in-One BEYOND** is optional. This mod works on its own; with DnD 5.5e loaded, its Giant feats replace DnD 5.5e's versions of the same feats - load this mod **after** DnD 5.5e.

---

✅ COMPATIBILITY
- Works on its own or on top of DnD 5.5e All-in-One BEYOND, and with other class/feat mods
- Works with **mod Configuration menu** if installed
- Safe to add to existing playthroughs (new characters only)

---

⚠️ NOTES- The advanced Giant feats (Ember, Fury, Guile, etc.) need the matching Strike type. Script Extender enforces this on the level-up screen; a locked feat shows "Strength needs to be higher than 99" - its description names the real prerequisite.
- Background feats (Strike of the Giants, Rune Shaper) are granted automatically with their backgrounds. Taking them separately at another level is not intended design.

---

📜 CREDITS- Content based on *Bigby Presents: Glory of the Giants* by Wizards of the Coast
- Background Feat technique made popular my yoonmoonsick
- Icons use existing BG3 spell icons
- VFX utilize existing BG3 status effects